WEBVTT

00:09:58.802 --> 00:10:00.846
As a great sage once observed,

00:10:00.846 --> 00:10:04.141
“mo money” may in fact correlate
with “mo problems.”

00:10:04.183 --> 00:10:06.352
(Laughter)

00:10:06.685 --> 00:10:10.481
The way forward is to figure out
what the public and private sector

00:10:10.522 --> 00:10:11.690
can each do best

00:10:11.690 --> 00:10:14.652
and help them figure out
how to stay in their lane.

00:10:14.652 --> 00:10:16.028
When it comes to government,

00:10:16.070 --> 00:10:17.655
I am open to the possibility

00:10:17.655 --> 00:10:21.116
that the answer
to what it can do best is ...

00:10:21.158 --> 00:10:22.409
nothing.

00:10:22.409 --> 00:10:23.410
(Laughter)

00:10:23.452 --> 00:10:25.788
But we don't all have to become
anarchists today.

00:10:25.788 --> 00:10:30.793
It's clear that liberal
institutions, rule of law,